    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "We measured DNA methylation in 40 patients from our discovery cohort and plasma proteomics in a different set of 40 patients from the replication cohort; nobody is in both. I want DRAGON to build one network of partial correlations between the methylation sites and the proteins."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"I want DRAGON to build one network of partial correlations between the methylation sites and the proteins.\" -- I couldn't match this to anything a registered NetZoo workflow produces or lets you set. DRAGON gives: one undirected partial-correlation network within and between two matched omics layers (any two, e.g. expression and methylation), across all samples. A p-value and a Benjamini-Hochberg adjusted p-value for every edge (adjusted within each layer and across the layers), to filter edges by significance.\n\nI couldn't match this to a result any registered NetZoo workflow produces, so none is offered.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
  ],
